WEBVTT

00:34:26.329 --> 00:34:32.038
I think my favorite my favorite character
in in Star Wars was Han.

00:34:32.038 --> 00:34:37.621
Just because I mean, it's very hard
to think of a better scene in

00:34:37.621 --> 00:34:43.329
a movie ever than when you meet Han Solo
and then in Empire Strikes Back.

00:34:43.329 --> 00:34:46.413
I mean, like there's just there
are some of the greatest,

00:34:47.038 --> 00:34:51.663
truest larger than life, but completely
relatable and grounded moments.

00:34:52.413 --> 00:34:56.121
And, you know, when we got to shoot
in Force Awakens, you know,

00:34:56.121 --> 00:35:01.413
Harrison and Chewie coming into the, you
know, the Falcon and saying, you know,